! RAINFALL CONTROL FILE (.TRFC)

RF GRID Format == NC                            ! Options - NC | TIF | ASC | FLT
RF Interpolation Method == IDW                  ! Options - IDW | POLYGON | TIN
! Read GIS RF Point == <path/to/2d_rf>          ! GIS layer defining point rainfall locations (required for IDW Interpolation)
! Read GIS RF Polygons == <path/to/2d_rf>       ! GIS layer defining rainfall polygons (required some Interpolation methods)
! Read GIS RF Triangles == <path/to/2d_rf>      ! GIS layer containing the triangulation of the rainfall points (used in TIN Interpolation)
! RF Grid Origin == <X, Y>                      ! Sets the origin for the output rainfall grid
! RF Grid Cell Size == <value>                  ! Sets the cell size for the generated rainfall grids
! RF Grid Size (X,Y) == <x_length, y_length>    ! Sets the size of the output grids
! RF Grid Size (N,M) == <rows, columns>         ! Alternate to the above command
